        "CCA": 0.016,
        "RCCA_B": 0.022,
        "LCCA_B": 0.012
      },
      "note": "MAP should stay similar across the three beds; PI = (vmax-vmin)/vmean."
    },
    "caveat": "Parameter values are illustrative mouse-scale starting points, NOT a calibrated fit. Calibrate stenosis_coefficient (band), the three RCR beds, and the ejection waveform to hit the Table-1 targets. See tests/cases/steadyFlow_calibration.json + svZeroDTuner."
